{
  "meta": {
    "filePurpose": "Focused Flint CC test macros for MC6 Pro v1 testing",
    "createdDate": "2026-03-14",
    "status": "best_guess_for_floor_testing",
    "notes": [
      "These values are intended as a practical starting point for testing, not as final tone definitions.",
      "All messages target the Strymon Flint on MIDI channel 6.",
      "The selected voices are 70s Plate for reverb and 65 Photo for tremolo.",
      "These macros are side-specific, so reverb macros should leave tremolo untouched and tremolo macros should leave reverb untouched."
    ]
  },
